OL,3,GNEWSAStudents swap Blu Tack and posters
OL,4,Afor original art
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents in Cambridge are ditching
OL,7,Ftraditional posters and Blu Tack in
OL,8,Ffavour of adorning their rooms with
OL,9,Fprofessional works of art.
OL,11,FFor almost 70 years, Kettle's Yard
OL,12,Fgallery in Cambridge has loaned framed
OL,13,Fart, from creatives like Ai Weiwei, to
OL,14,Fstudents from the city's universities
OL,15,Ffor a #20 fee.
OL,17,FSarah Kleinmoedhie, 22, a Politics
OL,18,Fstudent at the University of Cambridge
OL,19,Fwho was one of about 100 who collected
OL,20,Fa piece this year, said: "It makes for
OL,21,Fsuch a good conversation starter when
OL,22,Fyour friends come to your room."
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
